---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: validate caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_check_locked: cancelLocked == true (initializePublishSaleResults called)
    q_check_locked --> q_check_not_published: resultsPublished == false
    q_check_not_published --> q_validate_key: validate privateKey corresponds to publicKey
    q_validate_key --> q_set_claim_root: claimMerkleRoot = _claimMerkleRoot
    q_set_claim_root --> q_set_capital_root: acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot = _acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot
    q_set_capital_root --> q_set_totals: totalTokensAllocated = _totalTokensAllocated, totalCapitalAccepted = _totalCapitalAccepted
    q_set_totals --> q_release_key: privateKey = _privateKey
    q_release_key --> q_set_published: resultsPublished = true
    q_set_published --> [*]: emit SaleResultsPublished event

    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_locked --> q_revert_lock: not initialized
    q_revert_lock --> [*]: revert SaleResultsNotInitialized
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert_dup: already published
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_validate_key --> q_revert_key: key mismatch
    q_revert_key --> [*]: revert InvalidPrivateKey

    note right of q_release_key
        INV-001: privateKey matches publicKey (EC key pair validation)
        INV-002: resultsPublished transitions from false to true exactly once
        INV-003: after publication all bids become publicly decryptable
        INV-004: claimMerkleRoot and acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot are immutable after set
    end note
